      "value": "We really kinda need this. A few weeks ago someone abused a videoplayer and played porn on it in a very populated world with alot of children and everyone was disgust.\n\nBut tbh...idk how they would fix this \"issue\"\n\nThey will probably just create a fake account with fake age. Because if they would add something like \"ID Card\" stuff to proof someones age, \n\n I would quit vrchat tbh. That would go to far.\n\nI think the only thing to fix this is, that VRChat needs to change from free2play to pay2play (one time payment) to get rid of more children and trolls. BUT even that change would damage VRChat entirely and they would receive a extreme backlash .\n\nSo...it is a very complicated thing sadly.",
