  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-01-20T00:07:56.722Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I’ll be clear : people are horny on vrchat, this is not new, but obviously as a free game vrchat has a huge amount of kids in it, and I cannot recall the number of times that I have seen a child as an avatar with a penis dangling on their hips, or worse. Adding an age verification is the only way to make the game more safe and more welcoming to the adult oriented crowd.",
